"""Set W labels (round 44), written by hand from the official pages in pages/ before any extractor ran on set W.

Set W is the fifth fresh test set, collected after the round-43 rules and the second-reading checker were written: a
registry part (tests/heldout_w/collect.py: award links on the pages of scholarship_agent/sources.json not taken by set V)
and a search part (collect_search.py: country searches for fellowships and government programmes; official-looking hosts,
every labelled host of sets T, U and V left out). 426 pages were fetched on 2026-10-23; 100 single-programme pages were
labelled and the rest are excluded without a per-page reason (lists, several programmes on one page, news, staff or
research grants, forms, prizes, near-empty pages, or not reviewed). Labels follow the reading of sets L to V: fee status,
residence, enrolment, membership and region or group names without a list are "not_stated" nationality; a cash award whose
use is not stated is "not_stated" funding (paid per month or year: "stipend_only", marked as a close call); a stated share,
cap or fixed amount towards tuition is "partially_funded"; deadlines are applicant dates with a year; cycle_status as of
2026-10-23. Close calls are recorded per decision in AMB ("ambiguous_fields"); results are reported with and without them.
Run once to write labels.json; manifest.json then freezes it."""
